# Tools layout

- Implement in domain folders (`memory/`, `jira/`, …)
- Stable entry: `.cursor/tools/cli/<name>.mjs` → `forward()` to implementation
- Shared paths: `lib/paths.mjs` (`REPO`, `TOOLS_DIR`, `STATE_DIR`)
- State/logs only under `tools/state/`
- One `package.json` under `tools/`
